{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"No","category":"储能","country":"澳大利亚","country_iso":"AUS","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:36:21.302352","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"AUS-ES-0001","ldc":"No","location":"新南威尔士州","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"澳大利亚新南威尔士州长时储能项目","project_name_en":"New South Wales Long Duration Energy Storage Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"","content":"近日，澳大利亚新南威尔士州在长时储能领域迎来重大进展——第六轮长期储能项目招标结果正式出炉，6个大型锂电储能项目成功入选，并获签长期能源服务合同，为当地电网转型升级注入新动能。\n本次招标由AusEnergy Services Limited主导，该公司脱胎于澳大利亚能源市场运营商，依托深厚的行业积淀，保障了招标流程的规范与高效。\n值得留意的是，本次中标的全部项目均为锂离子电池储能系统，设计储能时长均超过8小时，充分契合长时储能的发展方向。从整体规模来看，本轮中标项目总装机容量约1.17 GW / 11.98 GWh，推动新州已签约的长期储能项目总量提升至约30 GWh，为电网接纳更多可再生能源、提升调峰调频能力提供了有力支撑。\n此外，尽管本轮中标项目中并无中国开发商直接入选，但在融资支持、合作伙伴及核心设备供应等方面，仍可见多家中国企业的身影，它们以不同形式深度参与到当地储能项目的建设中。","content_sha256":"fa65dad842c4b686d3147b7833e1c9bda47e1920fe02a376a515734ee4d9196a","id":66,"publish_date":"2026-02-18 12:01:03","title":"11.98GWh，澳大利亚新州第六轮长时储能招标落地，无中国投资企业中标","title_sha256":"e1e21cbfbe905c46361b3be0b4f5ae9a5001db04b44b9a863d4025b095f03858","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/92917.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"AUS-ES-0001","capacity_details":"BESS: 11.98 GWh","capacity_mw":1170.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"1170","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:36:21.302361","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"AUS-ES-0001-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://www.ditan.com/industry/energy-storage/6269.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"AusEnergy Services Limited (主导)","project_